<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Patch>
  <Operation Class="PatchOperationFindMod">
    <mods>
      <li>Vanilla Races Expanded - Highmate</li>
    </mods>
    <match Class="PatchOperationSequence">
      <success>Always</success>
      <operations>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>/Defs/InteractionDef[defName="SEX_ProposeSex"]/symbol</xpath>
          <value>
            <symbol>UI/Gizmo/Gizmo_InitiateLovin</symbol>
          </value>
        </li>
      </operations>
    </match>
  </Operation>
  <Operation Class="PatchOperationFindMod">
    <mods>
      <li>Ideology</li>
    </mods>
    <match Class="PatchOperationSequence">
      <success>Always</success>
      <operations>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>/Defs/PreceptDef[defName="Lovin_SpouseOnly_Strict"]/label</xpath>
          <value>
            <label>배우자만 허용</label>
          </value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>/Defs/PreceptDef[defName="Lovin_SpouseOnly_Moderate"]/label</xpath>
          <value>
            <label>연인만 허용</label>
          </value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>/Defs/PreceptDef[defName="Lovin_SpouseOnly_Moderate"]/description</xpath>
          <value>
            <description>연인 관계 밖의 사람과 사랑을 나누는 행위는 잘못되었다. 육체적 사랑은 배우자, 약혼자 또는 연인과만 나누어야 한다.</description>
          </value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>/Defs/PreceptDef[defName="Lovin_SpouseOnly_Mild"]/label</xpath>
          <value>
            <label>연인이 있다면 연인만 허용</label>
          </value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>/Defs/PreceptDef[defName="Lovin_SpouseOnly_Mild"]/description</xpath>
          <value>
            <description>혼인 관계 밖의 사람과 사랑을 나누는 것은 이해할 만하다. 하지만 연인 관계에 있다면 상대에게 충실해야 한다.</description>
          </value>
        </li>
      </operations>
    </match>
  </Operation>
</Patch>